Package: gst-plugins-imsdk-camsrc
Architecture: all
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
Conflicts: gstreamer1.0-plugins-qcom-camsrc,
           gstreamer1.0-plugins-qcom-qmmfsrc,
           gstreamer1.0-plugins-qcom-base,
Replaces: gstreamer1.0-plugins-qcom-camsrc,
          gstreamer1.0-plugins-qcom-qmmfsrc,
          gstreamer1.0-plugins-qcom-base,
Breaks: gstreamer1.0-plugins-qcom-camsrc,
        gstreamer1.0-plugins-qcom-qmmfsrc,
        gstreamer1.0-plugins-qcom-base,
Description: Qualcomm IMSDK GStreamer camera source plugin (qtiqmmfsrc)
 Provides the qtiqmmfsrc GStreamer element from the Qualcomm IM SDK
 (gst-plugins-imsdk, gst-plugin-qmmfsrc), built against the RadxaOS
 camera stack.
 .
 This package installs the same file as the Qualcomm PPA package
 gstreamer1.0-plugins-qcom-camsrc, so the two cannot be installed
 together.

Package: gst-plugins-imsdk-base
Architecture: all
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
Conflicts: gstreamer1.0-plugins-qcom-base,
Replaces: gstreamer1.0-plugins-qcom-base,
Breaks: gstreamer1.0-plugins-qcom-base,
Description: Qualcomm IMSDK GStreamer base libraries
 Shared base libraries used by the Qualcomm IMSDK GStreamer plugins
 (libgstqti{camera,video,gfx,utils,allocators,cv,memory,ml}base).
 .
 This package installs the same files as the Qualcomm PPA package
 gstreamer1.0-plugins-qcom-base, so the two cannot be installed
 together.
